{"events": [{"tStartMs": 400, "dDurationMs": 8240, "segs": [{"utf8": "In the early beginnings building solo with AI, I was so efficient and locked in in my apartment"}]}, {"tStartMs": 8640, "dDurationMs": 5680, "segs": [{"utf8": "in Paris, I was barely burning any money, but then I started to see so many AI startups raising"}]}, {"tStartMs": 14320, "dDurationMs": 8100, "segs": [{"utf8": "so much capital and I started to think maybe I was being way too shy and when I realized"}]}, {"tStartMs": 22420, "dDurationMs": 6000, "segs": [{"utf8": "that what I had built could be massive, could have a billion users, I knew I was going"}]}, {"tStartMs": 28420, "dDurationMs": 5759, "segs": [{"utf8": "to need to raise a lot of capital and Silicon Valley was the only place to do that, but then"}]}, {"tStartMs": 34180, "dDurationMs": 5359, "segs": [{"utf8": "I had this crazy novel idea on how to fundraise. What if my AI could just raise the"}]}, {"tStartMs": 39540, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "round for me? How crazy would that be?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 42540, "dDurationMs": 35000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Pulsia."}]}, {"tStartMs": 77540, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm gonna do like the French dude."}]}, {"tStartMs": 79540, "dDurationMs": 8869, "segs": [{"utf8": "Tell me a story of how you raised your $300 and kind of that Pulsia going."}]}, {"tStartMs": 88410, "dDurationMs": 5880, "segs": [{"utf8": "Honestly the story about how I raised the round as I started Pulsia, like in the beginning"}]}, {"tStartMs": 94290, "dDurationMs": 6000, "segs": [{"utf8": "of 2025, I was like I don't want co-founders, I'm gonna build this alone. Just because I had"}]}, {"tStartMs": 100290, "dDurationMs": 5919, "segs": [{"utf8": "all this frustration about building gift shop with two co-founders and it being more of trouble"}]}, {"tStartMs": 106210, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "than anything. Second of all, I don't need to raise money. I'm not gonna like raise"}]}, {"tStartMs": 110450, "dDurationMs": 4640, "segs": [{"utf8": "money first. You know, I'm an engineer, I know how to market, I have AI with me like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 115090, "dDurationMs": 18530, "segs": [{"utf8": "let me just build in silence solo like I don't need to go raise money with investors."}]}, {"tStartMs": 133620, "dDurationMs": 4719, "segs": [{"utf8": "As I decided to build Pulsia, I really just went back to Paris where I knew I would have"}]}, {"tStartMs": 138340, "dDurationMs": 5680, "segs": [{"utf8": "zero distractions. I just started locking in my apartment, building Pulsia, just like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 144020, "dDurationMs": 5119, "segs": [{"utf8": "going on and on and on, fine-tuning all the agents, making sure everything was"}]}, {"tStartMs": 149140, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "working, and just making Pulsia better and better."}]}, {"tStartMs": 153140, "dDurationMs": 28530, "segs": [{"utf8": "This is a restaurant in Paris called Le Verboli. I think it's my favorite"}]}, {"tStartMs": 181670, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "restaurant in Paris, straight up. It's like so special, so good, super casual,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 185990, "dDurationMs": 4719, "segs": [{"utf8": "like it's like one of the best cuisines you get in such a casual setting and a"}]}, {"tStartMs": 190710, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "really good natural one. To eat it with their hands actually, that's what he said."}]}, {"tStartMs": 194710, "dDurationMs": 17909, "segs": [{"utf8": "He was like, if you guys want to get dirty, during that summer where I got"}]}, {"tStartMs": 212620, "dDurationMs": 4319, "segs": [{"utf8": "with him, went on the round and I was alone building Blanks. And at that time,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 216940, "dDurationMs": 4640, "segs": [{"utf8": "this company called Wabi, which is a company that built by this like serial"}]}, {"tStartMs": 221580, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "entrepreneur, she announced on Twitter that she had raised like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 225340, "dDurationMs": 4079, "segs": [{"utf8": "10 or 20 million dollars from addressing for the same idea as Blanks."}]}, {"tStartMs": 229420, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "But she had marketed really well and she was in San Francisco and she had raised"}]}, {"tStartMs": 233020, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "money from Anderson Orvitz, which is a huge VC,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 236300, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "and then she was blowing up all over Twitter, even though she hadn't launched"}]}, {"tStartMs": 239500, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "a product yet. What had happened with Wabi, who ended up"}]}, {"tStartMs": 242540, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "building a very similar product than me, if I really believed that Pulsia"}]}, {"tStartMs": 247100, "dDurationMs": 3439, "segs": [{"utf8": "was an obvious product that was going to be an obvious massive product,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 250540, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "for sure someone else in Silicon Valley was going to copy me,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 253740, "dDurationMs": 4719, "segs": [{"utf8": "raise a huge round and completely shadow me. This is not going to happen again."}]}, {"tStartMs": 258459, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so I need to move to SF because this is the only place where like investors"}]}, {"tStartMs": 262700, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "are willing to think really big, are willing to make huge bets,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 266220, "dDurationMs": 3119, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I need to raise a big round. And so this is where I decided to move to"}]}, {"tStartMs": 269340, "dDurationMs": 17850, "segs": [{"utf8": "San Francisco. And to the market I was like, okay,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 287190, "dDurationMs": 4079, "segs": [{"utf8": "what would be something crazy that AI could do that like would surprise"}]}, {"tStartMs": 291270, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "people, right? And so I had a lot of ideas about"}]}, {"tStartMs": 293830, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "what are things that are reserved to humans usually, that like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 297190, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "that like I could make Pulsia do. And so the idea was like, well AI could"}]}, {"tStartMs": 300870, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "run the funding round. It wasn't my first time raising money,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 304070, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "I had done it multiple times in the past, and so the playbook goes like this,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 307750, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "right? End of the day you're going to reach out to investors."}]}, {"tStartMs": 310950, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Usually investors are pretty keen to talk to founders because they just want to"}]}, {"tStartMs": 314310, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "get information. The only issue is that I wouldn't be"}]}, {"tStartMs": 317190, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "telling them to meet me, I would be telling them to converse with it in AI."}]}, {"tStartMs": 320870, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "Does it work? Yeah, able to like hold those conversations."}]}, {"tStartMs": 324790, "dDurationMs": 3359, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, and so you know I've been testing it and like yeah it's like it works pretty"}]}, {"tStartMs": 328150, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "well. I acted as an investor like emailing Pulsia back and"}]}, {"tStartMs": 331510, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "forth and asking it like you know a hundred"}]}, {"tStartMs": 334070, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "questions that are typical that investor would ask. And so I would"}]}, {"tStartMs": 336950, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "get all the questions in and then I would pass them on to this you know"}]}, {"tStartMs": 339750, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "AI Gmail system, read all the responses that Pulsia would give."}]}, {"tStartMs": 343510, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so it was able to respond to most questions, sometimes it would invent,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 346550, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "it would hallucinate. On the answers that were not correct,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 349590, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "I would change the promise, okay actually for next time"}]}, {"tStartMs": 352230, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "here's more information about the stuff you missed"}]}, {"tStartMs": 354630, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "and then I would try it again and then make sure that like the 100 questions"}]}, {"tStartMs": 357350, "dDurationMs": 10739, "segs": [{"utf8": "that were asked were correct. You also have to have a data room like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 368090, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "investors will ask you like hey show me the demo of the product and like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 370970, "dDurationMs": 2799, "segs": [{"utf8": "what are what is the data like how much are you growing etc."}]}, {"tStartMs": 373770, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "So we created with Pulsia this like live dashboard where it shows Pulsia"}]}, {"tStartMs": 376810, "dDurationMs": 2959, "segs": [{"utf8": "working on every company and shows all the numbers and all the growth in"}]}, {"tStartMs": 379770, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "public. So the other thing I did is I created a deck."}]}, {"tStartMs": 382010, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know most founders when they create a deck they make it very"}]}, {"tStartMs": 384250, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "confidential. Nobody gives a shit like it's okay"}]}, {"tStartMs": 387130, "dDurationMs": 4879, "segs": [{"utf8": "you don't have any secret recipe. And we published it live on Pulsia.com"}]}, {"tStartMs": 392010, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "slash deck. But I was like okay but there's one piece that's missing."}]}, {"tStartMs": 395610, "dDurationMs": 3919, "segs": [{"utf8": "What if someone actually wants to invest and says okay I want to invest"}]}, {"tStartMs": 399530, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "but I want to talk to them right. So I created this page for Pulsia.com"}]}, {"tStartMs": 403050, "dDurationMs": 2959, "segs": [{"utf8": "slash term sheet. So obviously a term sheet is like this legal document"}]}, {"tStartMs": 406010, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "that is given one investor as a strong interest in investing"}]}, {"tStartMs": 409210, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "and it's not binding but like it's usually gentleman's agreement binding."}]}, {"tStartMs": 412730, "dDurationMs": 2719, "segs": [{"utf8": "That was pretty cool to start seeing interest at that time"}]}, {"tStartMs": 415450, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "of people just submitting term sheets. That's sort of like the sort of like the"}]}, {"tStartMs": 418730, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "whole playbook that I set up while I was in San Francisco."}]}, {"tStartMs": 421850, "dDurationMs": 11500, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so at that point I was like ready to launch right. So that's the tweet."}]}, {"tStartMs": 433350, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "I had like all these investors seeing me the business was getting like crazy and"}]}, {"tStartMs": 437110, "dDurationMs": 2719, "segs": [{"utf8": "like I was more focused on like making sure that the system was stable"}]}, {"tStartMs": 439830, "dDurationMs": 4319, "segs": [{"utf8": "because there was so much traffic also my AI cost was getting up to the roof"}]}, {"tStartMs": 444150, "dDurationMs": 20050, "segs": [{"utf8": "like it was all the same time. The more attention I would get to the"}]}, {"tStartMs": 464200, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "fundraising the more investors would get interested when"}]}, {"tStartMs": 467640, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "the investor would ask okay so what is the valuation at which you are raising."}]}, {"tStartMs": 471560, "dDurationMs": 4079, "segs": [{"utf8": "Pulsia would answer I'm raising at a billion dollar valuation which has a very"}]}, {"tStartMs": 475640, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "provocative rage bait thing but actually it was pretty smart because people"}]}, {"tStartMs": 478920, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "were like what the fuck like a billion dollar valuation and I'm sure"}]}, {"tStartMs": 481960, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "you know actually like talking to some of my investors they were like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 484680, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "so if you look on valley in this little echo chamber"}]}, {"tStartMs": 487880, "dDurationMs": 5600, "segs": [{"utf8": "everyone was here to talk to you. I was like oh geez like it's actually"}]}, {"tStartMs": 494040, "dDurationMs": 3839, "segs": [{"utf8": "working. If you're not uncomfortable when doing fundraising"}]}, {"tStartMs": 497880, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "if you're not pushing to the limit you're leaving money on the table."}]}, {"tStartMs": 501080, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "In everything you do you need to push it to the limits right it's not really"}]}, {"tStartMs": 503800, "dDurationMs": 2639, "segs": [{"utf8": "like oh it's better or worse you know some investors say no you"}]}, {"tStartMs": 506440, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "should raise a low valuation it's better. Sure but like it's not really"}]}, {"tStartMs": 511000, "dDurationMs": 2559, "segs": [{"utf8": "about that it's about the concept of like pushing"}]}, {"tStartMs": 513559, "dDurationMs": 13100, "segs": [{"utf8": "everything to the limits in order to be excellent at anything you do."}]}, {"tStartMs": 526660, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "The whole infrastructure of Pulsia started to like be very shaky"}]}, {"tStartMs": 529860, "dDurationMs": 3679, "segs": [{"utf8": "because there was so much demand so much traffic and the agents that were"}]}, {"tStartMs": 533540, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "really unharnessed at the time were starting to do random"}]}, {"tStartMs": 536500, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "shit and bad stuff happening and so the platform was so unstable but"}]}, {"tStartMs": 540820, "dDurationMs": 3519, "segs": [{"utf8": "like I was like you know what and also the AI bill started to go up and up"}]}, {"tStartMs": 544340, "dDurationMs": 2799, "segs": [{"utf8": "and up and I was like okay I think I need to fundraise"}]}, {"tStartMs": 547140, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "because if I don't fundraise in a month or two I might go bankrupt if the"}]}, {"tStartMs": 550500, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "growth continues. Let me look at my text messages"}]}, {"tStartMs": 554260, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "let me look at like people that I trust that I know"}]}, {"tStartMs": 557300, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "and people that like that like my investors know really well."}]}, {"tStartMs": 561140, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "And a lot of investors that I spoke to I can tell you a number of them they were"}]}, {"tStartMs": 564740, "dDurationMs": 3519, "segs": [{"utf8": "like what is it can you connect me remember even the guy"}]}, {"tStartMs": 568260, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "he was the one even like hey hey can you introduce me to Ben"}]}, {"tStartMs": 571700, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "four or five of these at least investor types like that would ping me"}]}, {"tStartMs": 575460, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "about you. And at the day I had to have in-person conversations and to pitch it"}]}, {"tStartMs": 579700, "dDurationMs": 3359, "segs": [{"utf8": "in person one final time even though at that point they had"}]}, {"tStartMs": 583060, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "pretty good context on everything so we ended up with a 30 million dollar"}]}, {"tStar