oing to win are the ones"}]}, {"tStartMs": 797000, "dDurationMs": 4399, "segs": [{"utf8": "that yes build the best product but also know how to market it really well"}]}, {"tStartMs": 801400, "dDurationMs": 5940, "segs": [{"utf8": "and so yeah that's the story of how I raised 30 million dollars for this"}]}, {"tStartMs": 807340, "dDurationMs": 2639, "segs": [{"utf8": "but the next round is going to be a different type of round because the next"}]}, {"tStartMs": 809980, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "round the friendways is not going to be about begging investors to give me"}]}, {"tStartMs": 813100, "dDurationMs": 2959, "segs": [{"utf8": "more money for no reason it would be demonstrating to them"}]}, {"tStartMs": 816060, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "very confidently that like polsia is working with data"}]}, {"tStartMs": 819260, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "and showing them that like if they give me another x million dollars"}]}, {"tStartMs": 823020, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can put this x million dollars into a marketing machine that I'm building"}]}, {"tStartMs": 826860, "dDurationMs": 3519, "segs": [{"utf8": "to this youtube content to an instagram tiktok"}]}, {"tStartMs": 830380, "dDurationMs": 3919, "segs": [{"utf8": "linkedin press now a lot of more press a lot more attention"}]}, {"tStartMs": 834300, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "a great sort of growth machine that if I put more money in that growth machine"}]}, {"tStartMs": 838380, "dDurationMs": 2639, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can acquire users they're going to be satisfied they're going to love the"}]}, {"tStartMs": 841020, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "product and and it's going to be a profitable business"}]}, {"tStartMs": 843900, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "which is also important because if you're not profitable you're going to"}]}, {"tStartMs": 846300, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "go bankrupt if you want to be customer obsessed you have to build a"}]}, {"tStartMs": 848860, "dDurationMs": 3679, "segs": [{"utf8": "profitable business that can survive and can thrive"}]}, {"tStartMs": 852540, "dDurationMs": 7720, "segs": [{"utf8": "so how much do you think you're raising the next round"}]}, {"tStartMs": 860260, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "probably a hundred million"}]}]}